OL,3,GNEWSAHow are sports clubs coping with
OL,4,Adrought?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela Walters, head of girls' football
OL,7,Fat Beacon Hill FC in Hindhead, Surrey,
OL,8,Fdescribed the state of their pitches as
OL,9,F"a huge concern" and called player
OL,10,Fsafety "paramount".
